# Always deploy

After making app changes (not docs-only chatter):

1. Rebuild with `./build.ps1 -Zip` so `build/*.pbw` and `dist/MakersOnStream-cloudpebble.zip` stay current.
2. Commit relevant source changes (never commit secrets, `build/`, or `node_modules/`).
3. Push to `origin` on GitHub without waiting to be asked.

Do not ask whether to deploy unless push fails or the user explicitly said not to push.
